<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">

  <!-- 「整合包分享 / 配置档切换」页签插件：把 .ckan 整合包导入成一个独立配置档，
       多个整合包共用一份游戏本体，靠宿主 IInstanceProfileService 的目录换出/换入切换。
       本插件只引用契约程序集，不引 CkanUI.App / CkanUI.Services / CkanUI.ViewModels。 -->
  <PropertyGroup>
    <RootNamespace>CkanUI.Plugin.ModPackShare</RootNamespace>
    <AssemblyName>CkanUI.Plugin.ModPackShare</AssemblyName>
    <AvaloniaUseCompiledBindingsByDefault>false</AvaloniaUseCompiledBindingsByDefault>
  </PropertyGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="Avalonia" />
    <PackageReference Include="CommunityToolkit.Mvvm" />
  </ItemGroup>

  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="../CkanUI.Services.Abstractions/CkanUI.Services.Abstractions.csproj" />
  </ItemGroup>

</Project>
